# Keep the build context small — everything the Dockerfile needs is
# backend/{Cargo.toml,Cargo.lock,src,entrypoint.sh} and frontend/{package*.json,src,…}.
# Without this the 2 GB backend/target and the runtime data/ get shipped to the
# build daemon on every `podman build`.
data
.env
**/node_modules
**/target
**/dist
**/.git
